    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have money problems and decide to take a very risky venture. Ancient burials have been found in an abandoned mine, but a group of archaeologists have disappeared there and it's about to be shut down! You decide to infiltrate and steal ancient artifacts to sell them on the black market!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/04b15bdab5847d2c307a9c8d7ae9aa9d.poster.avif?t=1754767084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/04b15bdab5847d2c307a9c8d7ae9aa9d.webm?t=1754767084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/04b15bdab5847d2c307a9c8d7ae9aa9d.mp4?t=1754767084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In it, you will have to experience the feeling of being constantly followed by someone, explore the surroundings of the forest and ancient tombs, and solve several puzzles to steal the cherished artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/b1aae577bca302ca5dbd968133ab9fef.poster.avif?t=1754767084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/b1aae577bca302ca5dbd968133ab9fef.webm?t=1754767084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/b1aae577bca302ca5dbd968133ab9fef.mp4?t=1754767084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic graphics</strong> and <strong>surround sound</strong> completely immerse you in the eerie atmosphere of this mysterious place! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have money problems and decide to take a very risky venture. Ancient burials have been found in an abandoned mine, but a group of archaeologists have disappeared there and it's about to be shut down! You decide to infiltrate and steal ancient artifacts to sell them on the black market!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/04b15bdab5847d2c307a9c8d7ae9aa9d.poster.avif?t=1754767084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/04b15bdab5847d2c307a9c8d7ae9aa9d.webm?t=1754767084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/04b15bdab5847d2c307a9c8d7ae9aa9d.mp4?t=1754767084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In it, you will have to experience the feeling of being constantly followed by someone, explore the surroundings of the forest and ancient tombs, and solve several puzzles to steal the cherished artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/b1aae577bca302ca5dbd968133ab9fef.poster.avif?t=1754767084\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/b1aae577bca302ca5dbd968133ab9fef.webm?t=1754767084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646810/extras/b1aae577bca302ca5dbd968133ab9fef.mp4?t=1754767084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic graphics</strong> and <strong>surround sound</strong> completely immerse you in the eerie atmosphere of this mysterious place! </p>",
